NHibernate Quick Reference Guide 1. Configuration and Session Factory Create Configuration:
var configuration = new Configuration(); configuration.Configure(); Build Session Factory:
var sessionFactory = configuration.BuildSessionFactory(); 2. Mapping Entities XML Mapping:
&lt;hibernate-mapping xmlns=&#34;urn:nhibernate-mapping-2.2&#34;&gt; &lt;class name=&#34;Namespace.EntityClassName, AssemblyName&#34; table=&#34;TableName&#34;&gt; &lt;!-- Mapping properties here --&gt; &lt;/class&gt; &lt;/hibernate-mapping&gt; Fluent Mapping:
public class EntityClassNameMap : ClassMapping&lt;EntityClassName&gt; { public EntityClassNameMap() { Table(&#34;TableName&#34;); // Mapping properties here } } 3. CRUD Operations Save or Update Entity:
using (var session = sessionFactory.
